6. Bug Log
Bug 1: Power shell error when activating virtual environment.
Caused due to security policy of windows.
Solution: Set execution policy in Powershell
Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned

Bug 2: Python not being identified in the terminal
Caused due to wrong installation of python.
Solution: Redownload and reinstall.

7. Key Learning
- How to properly create a development environment
- Importance of virtual environment
- How to verify installation of necessary ML libraries

8. Reflection
Creating a proper development environment is the first necessary step. This helps in managing dependencies and prevents future problems.